Usage example:

python3 portfolio.py -i /path/to/images/folder -o ./output --pdf --html --csv -n 12 --thumb 450 --sort date -r

With a title, an author and a watermark:

python3 portfolio.py -i /path/to/images/folder -o ./output --pdf --html --csv \
  --title "My Project" --author "My Name" \
  --watermark "My Name" --watermark-orientation "Diagonale horaire" --watermark-opacity 40

Full list of options: python3 portfolio.py --help
